      en: "Totota is a city in Bong County, Liberia, about 120 kilometers northeast of Monrovia on the Ganta-Monrovia highway. It serves as a vital trading hub for surrounding villages. The economy is dominated by agriculture (cassava, rice, vegetables). Population is around 10,000 (2022), mainly Loma and Kpelle. Facilities include a primary school, health center, and a weekly market.",
